# dgauss-9-element.dat -- the simplified 9-element dgauss lens used by the
# compiled-in "D8 Realistic Camera Cornell Box" showcase scene
# (src/TheRestOfYourLife/scene_registry_data.h's D8 entry, setup_camera
# lambda), reproduced here verbatim (same 9 rows, same 4 columns per row) so
# pbrt_scenes/cornell-realistic.pbrt's LightSource-free migration of that
# scene can load it through the generic "string lensfile" path
# (pbrt_load::parseLensFile()) instead of the hardcoded inline
# std::vector<double> the native scene builds in C++.
